@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classBorderColor #555555
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFBEA
skinparam noteBorderColor #B39B4D
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
hide circle
hide empty members
title E 段：報表參數型態決定「誰能傳進來」

interface SampleSource <<interface>> {
  + getSamples() : int
}
abstract class Rover <<abstract>>
class HeavyRover
class SampleTray
class "SampleReport（模擬 AI 版）" as AiReport #FADBD8 {
  + {static} print(label : String, source : Rover) : void
}
class "SampleReport（修正版）" as FixReport #DFF3E3 {
  + {static} print(label : String, source : SampleSource) : void
}
SampleSource <|.. Rover
SampleSource <|.. SampleTray
Rover <|-- HeavyRover
AiReport ..> Rover : 只收 Rover 家族
FixReport ..> SampleSource : 收任何實作者
note bottom of SampleTray
  SampleTray 不是 Rover
  → 傳給模擬 AI 版：編譯錯誤
  → 傳給修正版：可以
end note
@enduml
